    "updated_at": "2025-11-21T14:51:56Z",
    "body": "Right, I don't mean to suggest we get rid of that. Each URL-like object should support that, but I do think it's worth trying to hold the line here and get people to adopt the pattern that'll do the right thing in sandboxed environments and the like. We can always relent later. I'm also not entirely sure about `<a>` and `<area>`. The use cases for strings, globals, and message events seem clear though.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/3563341220/reactions",
